                                "sense_id": "f6a1d59d-d83a-3faa-b5c6-89e7c9caacba",
                                "text": "Ik kan niet voor anderman spreken, maar ik ben erg blij met de resultaten.",
                                "translation": "I can't speak for someone else, but I am very happy with the results.",
                                "english": "I can't speak for someone else, but I am very happy with the results."
