                                "sense_id": "f6a1d59d-d83a-3faa-b5c6-89e7c9caacba",
                                "text": "Laat anderman beslissen wat het beste voor hem is.",
                                "translation": "Let someone else decide what's best for them.",
                                "english": "Let someone else decide what's best for them."
                            },
                            {
